{"ref":"stage:mazerella","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Mazerella is a stage in Vampire Survivors. It is unlocked by reaching level 80 in ",{"t":"Dairy Plant","r":"stage:dairy-plant"}," while having Inverse Mode enabled."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Mazerella can be unlocked in the ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"recycletheplant\"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Stage","rows":[{"label":"Release date","cells":[["28 October 2025 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["EX_MAZERELLA"]]},{"label":"Type","cells":[["Challenge"]]},{"label":"Adventure only","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Time limit","cells":[["20:00"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Dancing_Widow.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Dancing Widow\""]]}]},{"title":"Modifiers","rows":[{"label":"Destructible chance","cells":[["7% (max 70% w/ Luck)"]]},{"label":"Max destructibles","cells":[["12"]]},{"label":"Starting spawns","cells":[["–"],["–"],["–"]]},{"label":"Player move speed","cells":[["x1.25"],["x1.25"],["x1.25"]]},{"label":"Enemy move speed","cells":[["–"],["–"],["–"]]},{"label":"Projectile speed","cells":[["–"],["–"],["–"]]},{"label":"Gold multiplier","cells":[["x1.3"],["x1.3"],["x1.3"]]},{"label":"Luck bonus","cells":[["–"],["–"],["–"]]},{"label":"XP bonus","cells":[["–"],["–"],["–"]]},{"label":"Enemy health bonus","cells":[["–"],["–"],["–"]]},{"label":"Enemy min","cells":[["–"],["–"],["–"]]}],"cols":["Normal","Hyper","Inverse"]}],"sections":[{"id":"description","title":"Description","blocks":[{"k":"quote","c":["A lactose labyrinth lies buried in the buttery basement of the Dairy Plant. Home to minotaurs and governed by Trickle-down milkonomics. Grabbing the bull by the horns and cheesing it through this mad maze is the only winning formula."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"effects","title":"Effects","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Enemies grow stronger over time, gaining +10% Max Health and +0.1% Movement Speed every minute. This effect stacks with ",{"i":"Sprite-Gracia's_Mirror.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:gracia-s-mirror"}," ",{"t":"Inverse Mode","r":"relic:gracia-s-mirror"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Mazerella is home to enemies that charge at the player, instead of simply running at them."]},{"k":"p","c":["Upon starting the stage, two invulnerable dancers spawn on either side of the player. These dancers will pick up any item they run into, including Relics, ",{"i":"Sprite-Treasure_Chest.png","w":24,"h":23}," Treasure Chests, and ",{"i":"Sprite-Experience_Gem.png","w":14,"h":18}," Experience Gems. To defeat these dancers, the player must chase them to specific rooms on both sides of the map, in which the dancers will become vulnerable and will drop all of their items upon death."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"hyper-mode","title":"Hyper Mode","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The hyper mode for this stage is unlocked by default after unlocking the stage."]},{"k":"p","c":["Hyper mode in Mazerella has +80% ",{"t":"Gold","r":"powerup:greed"}," and +10% ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"}," bonuses."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"items","title":"Items","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The following items can be found in this stage:"]}],"subs":[{"id":"items-stage-items","title":"Stage items","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Axe.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:axe"}," ",{"t":"Axe","r":"weapon:axe"}]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Knife.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:knife"}," ",{"t":"Knife","r":"weapon:knife"}]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Clock_Lancet.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:clock-lancet"}," ",{"t":"Clock Lancet","r":"weapon:clock-lancet"}]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Laurel.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:laurel"}," ",{"t":"Laurel","r":"weapon:laurel"}]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:armor-item"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"passive:armor-item"}," (×2)"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Wings.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:wings"}," ",{"t":"Wings","r":"passive:wings"}," (×3)"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Attractorb.png","w":18,"h":18,"r":"passive:attractorb"}," ",{"t":"Attract