", which possibly serves as a direct reference to the Minotaur itself (alongside ",{"t":"The Colossi","x":"https://teamico.fandom.com/wiki/The%20Colossi"}," from the game \"",{"t":"Shadow of the Colossus\"","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shadow_of_the_Colossus"},"."]}]}},{"c":[{"t":"Mozzarella","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/mozzarella"}," cheese"]},{"c":[{"t":"Tarantella","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/tarantella"},", a southern Italian folk dance popularly believed to be the therapy method for ",{"t":"tarantism","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/tarantism"}," which also was believd to be result from the bite of the wolf spider ",{"t":"Lycosa tarantula","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lycosa_tarantula"},"."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]}]}